              "value": "kcat is 12 sec(-1) for the dehalogenation of 3-iodo-L-tyrosine (at pH 7.4 and 25 degrees Celsius) (PubMed:27643701). kcat is 6.9 sec(-1) for the dehalogenation of 3-bromo-L-tyrosine (at pH 7.4 and 25 degrees Celsius) (PubMed:27643701). kcat is 5.0 sec(-1) for the dehalogenation of 3-chloro-L-tyrosine (at pH 7.4 and 25 degrees Celsius) (PubMed:27643701). kcat is 10.8 sec(-1) for the dehalogenation of 3,5-diiodo-L-tyrosine (at pH 7.4 and 25 degrees Celsius) (PubMed:27643701)."
