      "description": "Significant decrease in catalytic efficiency and reduced affinity for substrates 3-iodo-L-tyrosine (I-Tyr) and 3,5-diiodo-L-tyrosine (I2-Tyr). Larvae survival is decreased when fed a diet supplemented with 100 or 200um of I-Tyr but is increased when fed a diet enriched with 3-chloro-L-tyrosine (Cl-Tyr). However, adult survival is unaffected when fed a diet supplemented with halotyrosines.",
